"><div class="image image-mask ratio-square shape-circle"><img alt="Jan Dubský" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="auto" src="/files/r/1280/jan-dubsky.webp" srcset="/files/r/720/jan-dubsky.webp 720w, /files/r/1280/jan-dubsky.webp 1280w, /files/r/1920/jan-dubsky.webp 1920w"/></div></div></div><i class="icon icon-quote-right"></i><blockquote class="block-quote-text">U Protelu je pomer cena-výkon skvelý a podpora prvotriedna.</blockquote><div class="block-quote-author"><span class="quote-decor">–</span> Old Town Hotels <span class="quote-decor">–</span><span class="block-quote-info">Jan Dubský, CEO</span></div></div></div></div></div>
<div class="row-main"><div class="col col-1-12 grid-12-12"><div class="block block-button"><div class="center"><a class="btn btn-inverse btn-sm" href="/sk/nasi-zakaznici"><span aria-hidden="true" class="btn__icon"></span><span class="btn__label">ĎALŠÍ ZÁKAZNÍCI</span></a></div></div></div></div>
